# "Target creature you control": with only Bot2's Ornithopter on the battlefield Bot1 has no legal target and Ephemerate can't be cast (the refusal). Once Bot1 casts its
# own Ornithopter (the positive control) Ephemerate can be, and it blinks Bot1's, leaving Bot2's alone.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains
Ornithopter
Ephemerate
Plains x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
! Bot1.Hand.Ephemerate.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Ephemerate.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
[Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Turn = 3
Bot2.Battlefield = Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield = Plains; Ornithopter
Exile = Ephemerate
